<title>AUSTRIA: Austria issues 15 bln ATS 5.625 pct 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Austria issues 15 bln ATS 5.625 pct 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Kontrollbank, the Austrian government's financing agent, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 15 bln ATS</p>
<p>COUPON: 5.625 pct</p>
<p>MATURITY: May 2007</p>
<p>MAXIMUM YIELD: 5.84 pct</p>
<p>AVERAGE YIELD: 5.62312 pct</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE: 100 pct</p>
<p>PERCENTAGE OF BIDS FILLED: 51.33527 pct</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
